      "message": "net: stop monitoring select exceptions outside Windows\n\nWindows needs select's exception set to detect failed non-blocking\nconnects. On other platforms, a TCP urgent pointer can leave the\nexception set pending even when no data is readable. Only monitor it\non Windows, and disconnect established P2P peers if it is set.\n\nCo-authored-by: Antoine Poinsot <mail@antoinep.com>",
